{"id":"n74115-2-9","stage":4,"title":"재고 · 库存","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74115-2-9-1","ko":"지난번에 가져간 물건은 다 팔았는가?","zh":"上次拿去的那些东西都卖完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난번에","audio":"/audio/00bddae7b7dbaea35dd2.mp3"}},{"text":"가져간","meaning":"带上，拿上","explanation":"가져가다：带上，拿上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가져가다","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53811","senseId":"2","lemma":"가져가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져간","audio":"/audio/11154513ece0cf800a85.mp3"}},{"text":"물건은","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건은","audio":"/audio/2e3ce52c4ab7fb078a0e.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"팔았는가?","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는가：询问或自问，属于较传统的非敬语句末；加 요 可提高礼貌程度。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔았는가","audio":"/audio/a4e352a42ba2b55e9d3b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"d96cfec150bdc38f","term":"가져가다","zh":"带上，拿上","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3","entryId":"53811","definition":"拿去某个东西。","pronunciation":["가저가다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f35c6be215a006756c34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74115-2-9-2","ko":"아닐세, 아직도 재고가 창고에 한 가득이네.","zh":"没有啊，仓库里还堆满了库存呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아닐세,","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ세：向平辈或晚辈说明想法或感叹新发现的事实。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；ㄹ세：向平辈或晚辈说明想法或感叹新发现的事实。","readings":[{"term":"아닐세","audio":"/audio/1bb4a1f99b312b8a11fd.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닐세","audio":"/audio/1bb4a1f99b312b8a11fd.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"재고가","meaning":"库存，存货","explanation":"재고：库存，存货；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재고","audio":"/audio/6e1b9aecaabc2f386ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74115","senseId":"2","lemma":"재고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재고가","audio":"/audio/9837283c1b2ed5680d2e.mp3"}},{"text":"창고에","meaning":"仓库，库房","explanation":"창고：仓库，库房；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"창고","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71808","senseId":"1","lemma":"창고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창고에","audio":"/audio/2afaa8e284159768e04f.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"大概","explanation":"한：大概。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"3","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"가득이네.","meaning":"挤满，装满，充满","explanation":"가득：挤满，装满，充满；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득이네","audio":"/audio/41b07d1b1dcc91c6fb6c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"6e1b9aecaabc2f38","term":"재고","zh":"库存，存货","audio":"/audio/6e1b9aecaabc2f386ed1.mp3","entryId":"74115","definition":"还没有卖出或卖剩存放在仓库的物品。","pronunciation":["재ː고"]},{"id":"5f4ebee4ce9930e7","term":"창고","zh":"仓库，库房","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3","entryId":"71808","definition":"聚集或放置各种东西的地方。","pronunciation":["창고"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"大概","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"大约估计。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"260476e01310cd16","term":"가득","zh":"挤满，装满，充满","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3","entryId":"62661","definition":"事物或人多得没有空隙的样子。","pronunciation":["가득"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ee4395570b37b469458.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.733,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74115","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有啊，仓库里还堆满了库存呢。","这个仓库里有什么呢？